{
  "name": "dsh-edit-message",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Right-click a sent user message to edit it: the text returns to the composer, and the resent message voids the old one (hidden marker + greyed history) · 右键已发送的用户消息进行编辑：原文回到输入框，重发后旧消息作废（隐藏标记 + 置灰历史）",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "starash07",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/starash07/dsh-edit-message.git"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "message",
    "edit"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
